# Tutorial (hidden quest Tutorial), Bastok: a level 1 Warrior (nation 1) in Bastok Markets. Gulldago (no script; his
# default): Prog 0: 719 (Prog 1); 697 (Prog 2); no Signet: 698. The Signet (a GM's effect 253): 699 (6 Meat Jerky; a
# full inventory: none, Prog stays 2); Prog 3, no food: 700; food (effect 251): 701. Prog 4, no combat skill at 5
# (Sword 4 too): 702; Sword at 5 (a GM's setSkillLevel; getSkillLevel reads 5 at level 1): 703; finished: 100 x
# GIL_RATE gil, Prog 5. No Memorandoll: 704; with it and a full inventory: 705 finished: giveItem fails, Prog stays 5;
# with room: the Lizard Tail, Pot of Honey, Fire Crystal, Prog 6. Option 0: 706 (Option 2 too); the Auction Counter:
# Option 1, the auction menu, noAction; 707: the Conquest Promotion Voucher, Prog 7, Option 0. Level 1: 708. Prog 8 (a
# GM; the level 5 arm is #later's): no permit: 710; the permit with a full inventory: 711 finished: the Warp Ring
# fails, Prog stays 8; with room: the Warp Ring, Prog 9. TutorialBypass 0: 712 (1). Bastok Mines' Survival Guide
# (the quest arm only registers the guide and sends message 16066; the 8500 is the guide's own script): TutorialBypass
# 1, 16066, 8500; again: 1 is not 0: 8500 only. TutorialBypass 1 at Gulldago: 712 (1). North Gustaberg's guide: 2,
# message 12493, 8500 (param 20: bit 0x4000 cleared). Gulldago: 713 (1); full: no Saltena, Prog stays 9; TutorialBypass
# 3: 713 (1) too; with room: 12 Saltena, Prog 10, TutorialBypass 0. Level 1: 714. Prog 11 (a GM), no support job: 716
# (1). Prog 12: 718.
lists BastokMarkets/Gulldago/onTrigger BastokMarkets/Auction_Counter/onTrigger BastokMines/Survival_Guide/onTrigger NorthGustaberg/Survival_Guide/onTrigger BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/719 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/697 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/703 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/705 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/707 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/711 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/713
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-362,-10,-167 job=WAR lvl=1 nation=1
login
trigger Gulldago                        # Prog 0: 719
finish                                  # Prog 1
trigger Gulldago                        # 697
finish                                  # Prog 2
trigger Gulldago                        # no Signet: 698
finish
effect 253                              # a GM: the Signet
fill-inventory
trigger Gulldago                        # 699
finish                                  # no room: no Meat Jerky; Prog stays 2
